{"id":15620205285,"name":"Operation: Red Lake [Beta]","desc":"Version - 0.2.7\n─ ─ ─\nYou are an operative of the Emergent Threat Tactical Response Authority, a department of the SCP Foundation tasked with responding to various incidents and crises across the globe. While stationed at an ETTRA Command Center somewhere in Northern Canada, you and your fellow operatives were informed that communication with Site 354 was lost after a red mist erupted from the Red Lake, prompting a full site lockdown. ETTRA Operatives and Mobile Task Force units were deployed in order to investigate and regain control of the site. You are a part of the second wave of responders after communication with the first wave was lost. Find out what's going on and complete the mission.\n─ ─ ─","path":"/game/15620205285-operation-red-lake","slug":"15620205285-operation-red-lake","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/741a480824dc1daf968bc89e50002562c161ee65750f5ae569529e6735a96425.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-58e6822b5174d85d44f1d238c5ae9919/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":471259,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-15T17:54:47.002Z","creator":{"name":"[Emergent Threat Tactical Response Authority]","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Operation:-Red-Lake-Beta-need-script-please-111979","_id":"69920867473764a076b1aa64","title":"need script please","game":{"_id":"69920866473764a076b1aa61","gameId":15620205285,"name":"Operation: Red Lake [Beta]","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":15620205285},"features":"It would be possible to have the same script as in The Red Lake","tags":["OperationRed Lake"],"script":"attacking","owner":{"_id":"6616957ab89ca6e641adcc8c","username":"Lishnie_Chasti_Tela","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"